translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_914cae64:
    lm "就是这样。全都弄进里面去……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_decce631:
    lm "摸你妹妹光溜溜的小穴……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ab0fe44e:
    em "靠，这风险也太大了！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fa9605f9:
    em "但我现在停不下来。我不想…….."

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_22e64c2d:
    em "因为我想要我妹妹感觉真的很爽。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_87a594ee:
    lm "真大胆！两根他妈的手指……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_231a3bc3:
    em "操，感觉比昨天还紧。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_28c4e55c:
    em "一想到今天我们差点就——"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_a188698c:
    l "{size=-5}唔嗯……！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_1ac0e181:
    h "嗯？你没事吧，亲爱的？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_d98ae00d:
    l "没、没事，只是突然……{size=-5}咳嗽了一下。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_d6a0cacb:
    e "{size=-10}妈妈，又来了……？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fbdd6b40:
