translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ee7f82d2:
    l "啊，太可惜了！也许下次我会全程保持清醒……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_1c1728e5:
    l "不过话说回来，今晚我们至少享受了美好的家庭时光，对吧？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_c0af60b7:
    h "是啊……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_969d9717:
    l "好啦，我累死了！我要先去睡了。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_479b70df:
    e "对、对，我也是。好主意……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_2edd4afc:
    l "妈妈，家庭睡衣派对？我敢说你们昨晚想我了。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fb6a6a3e:
    h "诶？什么……？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f7772e04:
    l "你也可以有人陪，不是吗？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_6492ae73:
    h "我……没事的宝贝，今晚不行。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_1b2276b8:
    l "那好吧！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_5e06be1c:
    l "晚安妈妈。晚安，哥。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_8ca4740b:
    e "晚安，姑娘们。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_56d28944:
    h "你们两个晚安，做个好梦。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f2b957b8:
    hm "天啊，我……我只是……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_d4716532:
    hm "我真的要这么做吗？我变成什么了？！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f8dd18b6:
    hm "我真不应该！我真的不应该，可是……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_c518dc69:
    hm "我受不了了。我必须终于把这股张力释放出来。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_adeec09e:
    hm "一直憋着只会让我做出非常后悔的事……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_42afc2ba:
    hm "我就做一次。只做一次，让那股冲动消退……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_8b226e6a:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=25}{color=#f1d377}（ 就一次…… ）"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_296a6e6b:
    h "{size=+5}唔嗯！" with hpunch

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_76669af9:
    hm "已经好久……好久没这样了……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_3b7a48a7:
    hm "我年轻气盛的儿子……{size=-5}这股气味……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_8a6141de:
    hm "天啊，我从没见过纸巾会弄得这么黏糊……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ae82710d:
    hm "而且都是因为我。我让他射了，然后全部收拾干净。"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_3854111d:
    h "{size=+5}操，宝贝……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_cea6b45d:
    h "{size=+5}对！就是这样，小甜心！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_5e55cdcf:
    h "让妈妈感觉舒服……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_1a2f4784:
    h "你觉得它们怎么样，我的孩子？"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fd1155bf:
    h "你喜欢妈妈的大奶子吗？{size=-5}我知道你喜欢……"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ff98dbe9:
    hm "没错！吸我肥厚的乳头！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ba951ed7:
    hm "像你当年那样吸……！"

translate schinese hscene28_Erik_Lyna_Helga_1b42ebf8:
    hm "埃里克……我的爱人……我亲爱的小王子……"

translate schinese hscene29_Lyna_Helga_09534ad5:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{size=+10}{cps=20}深夜……"

translate schinese hscene29_Lyna_Helga_a8481935:
    lm "我还是不敢相信他们就他妈在我旁边干那种事！"

translate schinese hscene29_Lyna_Helga_7e7f480e:
    lm "我现在还怎么睡得着？"

translate schinese hscene29_Lyna_Helga_8f300eee:
    lm "我都已经射过一次了，可还是他妈硬得不行。"

translate schinese hscene29_Lyna_Helga_1911e69b:
